    "detailed_description": "Pebble wakes up alone in a big world. He only has his unique ability to manipulate time and the quest to find his parents. <br>Jump into a unique adventure, uncover what happened, visit mystical places and solve puzzles to reach your goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP \u2018N\u2019 ROLL</h2>Master your jumping skills and roll around a world full of challenges and mysterious traps.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANIPULATE TIME</h2>Shift objects through time and rebuild a wasteland. Combine your knowledge about time and space to reach new places.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A SMALL OPEN WORLD</h2>Visit different areas in the order you like. A unique set of challenges awaits you in every region.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND OUT WHAT HAPPENED</h2>Travel between past and present to discover what transpired before you woke up.",
